{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>A young bull.</b> A calf." "<b>Choice flour.</b> Three tenths, as per the rule." "<b>You shall take for a sin-offering.</b> In the imperative, for they shall take, and the meaning is they shall give, like ויקחו לי תרומה, or they shall take with them, like ויקחו להם איש שה לבית אבות."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:47.154719553Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}